    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Race tiny trucks around a circuit.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take control of one of up to 8 off road racing cars and race around a off road track with jumps and dips.\u00a0<br><br>Each race can be as short or long as you'd like it to:\u00a0<br>Want to watch 8 bots compete around the track for 999 laps? Want to race all by yourself in a 1 car only race? Go for it!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features AI controlled bots and local multi player. Controls include keyboard and controller.\u00a0<br><br>The race consists of waypoints and the game keeps track and shows the race positions of each of the cars.<br><br>The maps will include all sorts of obstacles to avoid or use to your advantage.<br><br>The game is early access and still under heavy development.\u00a0<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736940/extras/591c1d4539c0ead8a3b9d3ecc7a2c34b.poster.avif?t=1754335612\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736940/extras/591c1d4539c0ead8a3b9d3ecc7a2c34b.webm?t=1754335612\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736940/extras/591c1d4539c0ead8a3b9d3ecc7a2c34b.mp4?t=1754335612\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736940/extras/3cd4865669db9796e2a81ebc3da97e5b.poster.avif?t=1754335612\" width=800 height=494 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736940/extras/3cd4865669db9796e2a81ebc3da97e5b.webm?t=1754335612\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736940/extras/3cd4865669db9796e2a81ebc3da97e5b.mp4?t=1754335612\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is inspired from the beloved &quot;Ironman&quot; Off Road game.\u00a0</p>",
